{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/f37c3c3785e0e39f25b95b82ec52870b.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/f37c3c3785e0e39f25b95b82ec52870b.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/f37c3c3785e0e39f25b95b82ec52870b.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has survived the first wave of an alien invasion \u2014 mysterious UFO ships have descended on the Almakhill district, bringing not only destruction but also a frightening &quot;gift&quot; \u2014 a mutating virus that alters human DNA. Most of those infected by the virus have turned into aggressive mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c484b6ff886cb2b0de9409068f13ce1d.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c484b6ff886cb2b0de9409068f13ce1d.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c484b6ff886cb2b0de9409068f13ce1d.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the \u201cadapted,\u201d a former scientific soldier of a special unit caught in the epicenter of the catastrophe. To survive, you must develop your body through genetic modifications, unlocking new abilities \u2014 from superhuman strength and accelerated regeneration to unique effects caused by mutated organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/a9376b81f293a71c3685b94b78cf162c.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/a9376b81f293a71c3685b94b78cf162c.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/a9376b81f293a71c3685b94b78cf162c.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the infected zones, fight mutants and hostile alien life forms, collect DNA fragments, and decide how to evolve: become humanity\u2019s last hope \u2014 or its new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c37edfaf75b626b374a9fe9c6252f43e.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c37edfaf75b626b374a9fe9c6252f43e.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c37edfaf75b626b374a9fe9c6252f43e.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Develop your bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Build your base and defensive structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Explore the world and gather supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Defend your base from mutant attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Modify your body and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/6c97bd7a719b3aca44b2e34fb86ddcb1.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/6c97bd7a719b3aca44b2e34fb86ddcb1.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/6c97bd7a719b3aca44b2e34fb86ddcb1.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Gameplay</strong><br>Survive alone or with friends. Share items and work together to build defenses. Explore the secrets of Almakhill district, including its classified bunkers and laboratories.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803030?t=1752800286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/e95399c8a86874037b4a14d51ab8097a324098fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752800286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/4fdd67b1100193f2b73262b86088d5fd59bd3b1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752800286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/4fdd67b1100193f2b73262b86088d5fd59bd3b1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752800286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game \"Adaptation\" contains scenes of graphic violence, blood and gore, horror themes, and occasional nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/f37c3c3785e0e39f25b95b82ec52870b.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/f37c3c3785e0e39f25b95b82ec52870b.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/f37c3c3785e0e39f25b95b82ec52870b.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has survived the first wave of an alien invasion \u2014 mysterious UFO ships have descended on the Almakhill district, bringing not only destruction but also a frightening &quot;gift&quot; \u2014 a mutating virus that alters human DNA. Most of those infected by the virus have turned into aggressive mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c484b6ff886cb2b0de9409068f13ce1d.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c484b6ff886cb2b0de9409068f13ce1d.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c484b6ff886cb2b0de9409068f13ce1d.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the \u201cadapted,\u201d a former scientific soldier of a special unit caught in the epicenter of the catastrophe. To survive, you must develop your body through genetic modifications, unlocking new abilities \u2014 from superhuman strength and accelerated regeneration to unique effects caused by mutated organs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/a9376b81f293a71c3685b94b78cf162c.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/a9376b81f293a71c3685b94b78cf162c.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/a9376b81f293a71c3685b94b78cf162c.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the infected zones, fight mutants and hostile alien life forms, collect DNA fragments, and decide how to evolve: become humanity\u2019s last hope \u2014 or its new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c37edfaf75b626b374a9fe9c6252f43e.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c37edfaf75b626b374a9fe9c6252f43e.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/c37edfaf75b626b374a9fe9c6252f43e.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Develop your bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Build your base and defensive structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Explore the world and gather supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Defend your base from mutant attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Modify your body and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/6c97bd7a719b3aca44b2e34fb86ddcb1.poster.avif?t=1752800286\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/6c97bd7a719b3aca44b2e34fb86ddcb1.webm?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/extras/6c97bd7a719b3aca44b2e34fb86ddcb1.mp4?t=1752800286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Gameplay</strong><br>Survive alone or with friends. Share items and work together to build defenses. Explore the secrets of Almakhill district, including its classified bunkers and laboratories.</p>","developers":["RedLever"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803030/2c7a95cc9d88e7b90d092a09ec480cfc6d3909ca/header.jpg?t=1752800286","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3803030/322285734/5e71df56ceedd2d7ef48fc0d5f4416245897fa81/1750367848/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751499771","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3803030/322285734/5e71df56ceedd2d7ef48fc0d5f4416245897fa81/1750367848/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751499771","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://